WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.630
Hey.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:08.800
I came across that kid in the forest.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.554
What? He's still alive?

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:15.557
He's got the Troll of Jom's blood in him.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.517
He won't just drop dead.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.275
Like father, like son.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:57.390
You can't let a big sword
like that swing you around.

